      "note": "Tesseract 5.5.0.20241111 (UB Mangoes build, via scoop) \u2014 NOT the 5.5.1 the darwin-arm64 pin and the fixtures/scan corpus were recorded on; no Windows build of 5.5.1 is published. Self-contained: 34 bundled DLLs, all hash-pinned. Line segmentation matches darwin exactly on the fixture pages (identical band boxes and psm), but RECOGNITION differs on roughly 5% of lines (7 of 138: 'rebellion'->'tebellion', stray trailing punctuation) and confidences differ throughout. The models were trained against the darwin segmentation, so Windows output is expected to be very slightly worse until either a 5.5.1 Windows build is vendored or the corpus is re-measured against this one. See vendor/tesseract/README.md.",
